## 6. Possible Issues If Link Fails

| Issue | Likely Cause |
|---|---|
| 404 / blank page | Offer expired, paused, or removed |
| No conversion attribution | Cookie blocked, postback misconfigured, or SubID lost |
| Source not credited | AdMedia postback URL not firing or CID mismatch |
| Click blocked | Trafee fraud filter or untrusted source restriction |

